{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"觀所緣論釋","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"護法菩薩造","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]唐三藏法師義淨奉製譯","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"若言能令毒智人　爲令其慧極明了　及爲消除於罪惡　稽首敬已觀其義。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"論曰.","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"諸許眼等識者.","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於所棄事及所收事或捨或取.是觀察果故.所捨事體及顛倒因是所顯示。此中等","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"言謂攝他許依其色根五種之識.由他於彼一向執爲緣實事故。意識不然.非一向","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"故.許世俗有緣車等故.縱許意識緣實事境有其片分.亦能將識相似之相離無其","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"境.於眼等識境不相離得成就已方爲成立.是故於此不致慇懃。又復於慣修果智","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"所了色誠非[二]呾迦所行境故.及如所見而安立故.今此但觀聞思生得智之境也.如","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"斯意識所緣之境全成非有.此於自聚不能緣故.復緣過未非實事故.猶若無爲.爲","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]原刻題號首有大字．今删．","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]Ｔarka卽黠慧．","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此等言攝五識身。若爾.根識引生所有意識斯乃如何。非此共其根識同時.或復無","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"間.皆滅色等爲所緣故。或緣現在此非根識曾所領故.斯乃意識自能親緣外境體","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"性.此則遂成無聾盲等.復違比量知有別根。此遮增色是所欲故.然於意識不復存","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"懷。眼等諸識色爲依緣而方有故.無表但是不作性故自許是無.本意如此。此於","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"所緣","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"將爲現量.是所取性故.深履邪途故.爲此正意遮所緣性.因便方遮斯所依性.同時","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"之根功能之色將設許之。言","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_24","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"外境","sortOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"者.彼執離斯而有別境.此顯其倒.顯彼執有異事可取故言境也。如何當說或緣總","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_26","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"聚.由非總聚實事應理。誠如來難.彼自前後道理相違.餘復何失.緣其實事及緣總","sortOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"聚是所許故.將欲敘其別過.爲此且放斯愆。","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"或許極微.","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_30","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"雖復極微唯共聚已而見生滅.然而實體一一皆緣.不緣總聚.猶如色等設自諸根","sortOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"悉皆現前境不雜亂.彼根功能各決定故。而於實事斷割有能.一一極微成所緣境。","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"彼因性故.","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"彼眼等識之因性故.是彼生起親[一]支分義。然而有說其所緣境是識生因.在諸緣故。","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"或復於彼爲總聚","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"者.彼諸論者執衆極微所有合聚爲此所緣。","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_36","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"相識生故.","sortOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由於總聚而生其智.是故定知彼爲所緣.如有說雲.若識有彼相彼是此之境。此二","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"論者鹹言彼相應斯理故.若不言因.此因無喻.猶如因等成因等性。極微總相是所","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"緣性而成立之.又若自許不於識外緣其實事.應有有法自相違過。然法稱不許.斯","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"乃於他亦皆共許卽以爲喻.若但如所說.應於所立義而屬當之。前量意雲.論本二","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"因但是明因所以.不卽是因.以無共成之喻.爲此須出彼相應因何以如此。次復顯","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_43","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]原刻作友．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"己所論之理是無謬妄。明他共許置第五聲.","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]設許爲因.","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"猶如共許。諸非有事非有性故非因極微.而且縱許諸極微體是其因性.但說不合","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"是所緣性。","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由非彼相.","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"極微相故。此雲","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_51","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"根識極塵非境如根","sortOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_52","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"者.言猶如於根縱實是識親依之因.無根相故非彼之境.極微亦爾。諸無其相彼非","sortOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"斯境者.何謂也.爲此說","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"其名境者[二]等。","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"言自性者謂自共相.了者定也。如何此復名爲了耶.","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如彼相生故。","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_58","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]以下四句牒論本第一頌．","sortOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]此牒論本文略．原本雲．謂識决了自性．","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_61","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此言意者.同彼相貌而識生起.由隨彼體故此則說名了彼境也。而實離識無別所","sortOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"了可與其識爲因性耶.然而但有前境相狀.於其自己猶如鏡像而安布之.共許名","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"斯爲了其境。然非極微一一自體識隨彼狀由此極微而爲境體。","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"縱有因性.","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由非因義所緣。","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如根.","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_67","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"雖是因性不爲所緣.若由因性許作所緣.根亦同斯應成彼也。斯言前說彼相應理","sortOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"故因有不成過。然而意顯非唯因性卽是其根所緣之相.若如所說因將爲能立者.","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"則彼因性故爲所緣性耶.於根亦有成不定過。若如是者.","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由非彼相.","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"其義何也。爲明成立自己之宗.由非但述他宗過故己義便成.此言爲彰非卽能生","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"自識相故境非極微猶如眼等。若其是彼因性之言將爲論主前立他宗明他共許.","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此時意在遮他顯己能破義成置斯言矣。宗許定彼.不定他宗恐其不許。向者與他","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"出不定成卽是能破.何假自宗更伸比量。凡言不定未必決定不成.恐致疑惑是故","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"更須立量。[一]或可由斯非彼相者.於諸極微非定了性。如相識生是謂決了.旣彼非故","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"明知決了此亦無由.應可說非決了性故。惟出此因不是所緣.如根極微。有餘復作","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"諸識差別顯其成立眼識不能了極微色.無彼相故.如餘根識.如是餘識翻此應言.","sortOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_79","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如根之言誠爲[二]乘也.其喻別須義準而出。又復縱是因性之言爲無用矣。彼雖因用","sortOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_80","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"非所緣性.此亦如是實爲有用.然非聲等所有極微可是餘根之識生因。有說於識","sortOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_81","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"自體無聚現故非是所緣.如根衆微。由境相狀安布於識是彼相性.此非有故.理卽","sortOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_82","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"說其無有聚現。","sortOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_83","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如是且述[三]鉢囉摩怒不是所緣.","sortOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_84","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"彼之能立不相應故.及非境性量善成故。若爾.總聚是境。然由所說諸有能立若望","sortOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_85","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"謨阿宗皆有不成性.理實如此。","sortOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_87","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]次出異解．","sortOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_88","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]疑係剩字之誤．","sortOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_89","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]Parama^n!u卽極微．又囉字原刻作羅．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_91","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"然而總聚實有彼相.","sortOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_92","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"可是所緣.無因性故。","sortOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_93","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]由彼相識不能生.","sortOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_94","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"其總聚相識總聚不生.彼旣不生此識.如何令此緣彼.所緣之相不相應故非所緣","sortOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_95","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"義.由此前雲彼相應理斯乃不成。若爾.何謂所緣之相。","sortOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_96","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"凡是境者理須生其似自相識.","sortOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_97","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"隨境之識.彼是能生.彼是所緣。有說凡爲境者理必須是心及心生起之因也.此旣","sortOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_98","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"生已隨境領受而興言論.於時名此爲所緣境.若義具斯二種相者此乃方合名爲","sortOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_99","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"所緣.是能生性.所緣之境。引阿笈摩.","sortOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_100","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此卽便是說生緣性。","sortOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_101","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由是生因彼識生緣.共許是其所緣之境。自體相現.此中無益.故不言之。","sortOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_102","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]能非總聚是能生者.[三]非實事故.","sortOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_104","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]此牒論本第二頌初句．","sortOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_105","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]疑係然字之誤．","sortOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_106","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]此合下文猶如二月．牒論本第二頌次句．","sortOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_108","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由其總聚不是實事.此於有聚一異二性不可說故。又復無有不實之事能有生起","sortOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_109","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"果用功能.","sortOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_110","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"猶如二月.","sortOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_111","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如第二月不能生識第二月相。若爾.何因有斯相現。","sortOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_112","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"根損害故.","sortOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_113","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"若時眼根由翳等害損其明德.遂卽從斯損害根處見二月生.非實境故。","sortOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_114","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由此二月縱有彼相然非斯境.","sortOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_115","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如第二月縱令此識有彼相狀.由不生故不名斯境。","sortOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_116","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此由非實事有性等總聚不是識之生因.","sortOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_117","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"非實性故.如第二月。由斯方立非因性故.","sortOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_118","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"不是所緣.","sortOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_119","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"還如二月。又復將此第二月喻於彼相因.應知說其不定之過。復由識義理成就故.","sortOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_121","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"過是相違。復緣眼識不緣青等聚集極微.爲由彼體非生性故.如餘根識.此喻共許","sortOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_122","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"故不別言。第二月喻非實事故.應知此是於非因性而成立之。如所說之縱有相性","sortOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_123","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"然非彼境.斯言復是非彼因義。若言無有第二月者.如何現見有二相生。謂從內布","sortOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_124","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"功能差別均其次已.似相之識而便轉生.猶如夢時見有境起.由此令似妄作斯解.","sortOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_125","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於其月處乘更覩餘。諸有說雲.而於眼識雙現之時.此二次第難印定故將作同時.","sortOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_126","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於斯二種相貌之後意識便雲我見月之第二月也。或復有雲.於共許月數有錯亂.","sortOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_127","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由根損故。若望不許外境之宗.如斯衆見但是妄執。由非眼識所緣無間引生意識","sortOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_128","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"能於一時雙緣兩相作如斯解見二月耶.又於聲等緣彼之識不知其次應有二聲","sortOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_129","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"等見同時起耶.好眼之人意識次第尚多難解.何況依於色根之識[一]測其差別便成","sortOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_130","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"多有。二相等見一[二]旃達羅.若時離識許實有者.斯乃何勞妄增二月而言於數有其","sortOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_131","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"錯亂。","sortOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_132","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]離識之外執有二種.","sortOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_134","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]原刻作惻．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_135","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]Candra卽月．","sortOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_136","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]次二句牒論本第二頌後半．","sortOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_138","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"極微總聚.此皆闕其一分義故.又如所說能立能斥道理力故.","sortOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_139","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"以之爲境成不相應。闕一分故.","sortOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_140","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"自體相現及能生性.具斯二分方是所緣.於極微處卽闕初支.於第二邊便亡第二。","sortOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_141","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"若如是者.如向所論二種過失重更收攝令使無差。","sortOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_142","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]有說集相","sortOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_143","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"者.於諸極微處各有集相.卽此集塵而有相現.隨其所有多少極微此皆實有。在極","sortOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_144","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"微處有總聚相.生自相識.實有性故.","sortOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_145","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"應是所緣.","sortOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_146","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"斯乃雙支皆是有故。此卽於前所有成立求進無由.爲聚集相卽是極微.爲不爾耶。","sortOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_147","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由諸境義有衆多相.","sortOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_148","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"卽此諸微許有微狀.亦有集相.如何得令兩相共居一事爲應理乎。有衆多相.凡諸","sortOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_149","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"有色合聚之物皆以地等四大爲性.彼皆自性有勝功能.青美等相隨事隨根而爲","sortOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_151","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]次二句牒論本第三頌前半．","sortOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_153","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"了別.卽此於其衆多相處極微之處","sortOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_154","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"有總集相.","sortOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_155","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"卽將此[一]相爲眼等識所行境故.","sortOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_156","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"是現量性。","sortOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_157","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"若如是者.於諸微處識有聚相何不言之.塵有聚相.何不言識有聚相耶。所以復雲.","sortOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_158","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"然於微處有總聚相.","sortOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_159","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"卽以此言爲其方便.亦顯識有極微總相。若爾.一一極微有此相者.何故復雲總集","sortOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_160","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"相耶。色聚衆多極微分別是論所許.此卽是其總聚性故不是實有.如前已陳.何勞","sortOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_161","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"重述。有別意趣.縱令實事別別體殊.然此相狀但於集處更相藉故而可了知.說觀","sortOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_162","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"集相更無餘矣。又復設使諸有極微合聚爲性.然而一事有其勝劣.隨事觀之.且如","sortOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_163","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"蒼色是其地界。如是等說誠爲應理.縱許如是.如極赤物初生起時多事皆強遂無","sortOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_164","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"容矣.依容有處作此[二]譸議。若爾.如何諸極微非根所見.又復如何唯有如知能見極","sortOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_166","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]原刻次二字互倒．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_167","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]原刻作議．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_170","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]由其塵相非是識義.","sortOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_171","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"非是依根識之境界故曰非根。非根之義獨是如知之所觀察.復如何理。現見極微","sortOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_172","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"塵形不覩.","sortOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_173","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如堅性等。如堅潤等","sortOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_174","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於彼青等","sortOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_175","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"縱有其事.非是眼等識之境界.","sortOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_176","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"根之功能各決定故。","sortOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_177","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"塵亦如是。","sortOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_178","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"無違共許.豈非顯微無其堅性由別體故。此對宗法許共十處但是大種.斯言無過.","sortOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_179","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"然此已陳。","sortOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_180","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]汝瓨甌等覺","sortOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_182","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]此合下文如堅性等．牒論本第三頌後半．","sortOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_183","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]次二句牒論本第四頌前半．","sortOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_185","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"者.汝如是證者.於瓨及甌便成根覺","sortOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_186","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"相似而觀.","sortOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_187","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於其自境識不差故.復由根覺隨現有境而相生故。識境不別.如何得知。","sortOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_188","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由匪於其瓨甌等處衆微有別.","sortOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_189","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"而此言說然諸極微以總聚相而爲其境.固非於彼瓨等自體了別之時於衆多聚","sortOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_190","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"體有片別.彼之實事相貌之外無別積聚體可得故。緣彼根識便成相狀無有差殊.","sortOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_191","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由此方成於塵自體是所緣性。復非於彼無別相處覆審之緣異解性故.如緣青等。","sortOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_192","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]若相殊故所言殊","sortOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_193","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"者.相謂形狀.布置有殊。","sortOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_194","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於其瓨甌胭腹底等珠異狀故.由境有別覺乃遂殊.","sortOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_195","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"誠爲應理。","sortOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_196","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]無如是事.","sortOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_198","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]此牒論本第四頌第三句．","sortOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_199","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]此牒論本第四頌第四句．","sortOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_201","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"非於根識所觀境處極微有殊。然此總聚是[一]三佛栗底.而此總聚非根識境此已斥","sortOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_202","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"破.復非非境有別而令識相有殊可爲應理。復如何知諸極微處別狀非有。","sortOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_203","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]極微形相無別異故.","sortOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_204","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"凡諸事物有支分者必有別狀於方處轉.然諸極微體無方分至窮極處.斯卽何曾","sortOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_205","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"得有形別。","sortOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_206","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於瓨甌等縱令事別.而極微性曾無有殊。","sortOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_207","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"斯乃一體無增減故.","sortOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_208","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]是故定知","sortOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_209","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於總聚處","sortOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_210","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"非實物有。","sortOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_211","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"凡有方隅布列形狀.皆非根識所行之境。上來如此衆多詰責.意欲顯其有別相故.","sortOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_212","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"瓨甌等覺非於別事爲所緣境.猶若[四]蘇佉毒佉情矣。然而極微是不別境.卽是彰其","sortOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_214","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]Sam!vr!ti卽世俗．後文亦譯覆相．","sortOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_215","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]此牒論本第五頌初句．","sortOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_216","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]此合下文非實物有．牒第五頌次句．","sortOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_217","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[四]Sukhaduh!kha卽樂苦．","sortOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_219","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"非彼境性。[一]若相殊故方言殊者.此言意顯向雲非以不別之事而爲境者是立已成。","sortOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_220","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"彼意說言極微爲境其實無殊.然爲形相別故別也。極微無殊我亦共許.是立已成.","sortOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_221","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由諸極微量無別故.此顯殊事是其別境.答非已成。或可此明諸根之識於瓨甌等","sortOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_222","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"無有極微相狀性故.非是所緣.猶如餘識.餘識謂意或餘根識.但緣[二]青時無黃相故。","sortOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_223","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"於諸極微雖體衆多無差別故.而諸根識差別相故.斯乃共成非塵狀性.頌於極微","sortOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_224","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"差別之言同前問答。若其總聚許覆相已.形非實境理方可成.如斯勝理是應成立.","sortOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_225","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"若言離極微如是等.","sortOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_226","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]如離彼者.彼覺便無故。","sortOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_227","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"猶如軍等.此言瓨等是非實義.由非實事。此顯餘宗","sortOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_228","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"諸非不實皆非捨彼","sortOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_229","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"相違事也.如於聲等青覺非有.此形相別是覆相有.以其瓨等爲境性故。雖引衆多","sortOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_230","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"異見道理.而竟不能顯其極微實事之體有其差別。","sortOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_232","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]次出異解．","sortOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_233","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]原刻作情．今依麗刻改．","sortOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_234","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[三]此牒論本第五頌後半．","sortOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_236","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]據內境體.","sortOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_237","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"謂立自宗所緣之事。若也總撥無所緣境.便有違世自許宗過.四種緣性於經說故。","sortOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_238","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此中內聲爲顯不離於識而有所緣.言境體者是所取分.是識變爲境相之義。然在","sortOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_239","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"識外別分而住將以爲境.違世之過如前尚在.由諸世俗共許於境在外而住。應雲","sortOrder":239},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_240","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如外.此不離識.其所取分","sortOrder":240},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_241","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如外而現。","sortOrder":241},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_242","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"雲我見境生其慢想.實此爲因.如於眼識現其髮等。","sortOrder":242},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_243","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"外境雖無.","sortOrder":243},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_244","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"謂實無其在外之境.非了性故.以理究尋不可了其自體定在於外.縱令許彼實有","sortOrder":244},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_245","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"外相.然非識緣.非彼相性故.非極微相現。","sortOrder":245},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_246","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如似外相顯現之時.此卽是其所緣緣也。","sortOrder":246},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_247","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"彼相相應故。由若與相理相應故者.此卽是此.如因性等由與自相理相應故。復顯","sortOrder":247},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_249","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]次二句牒論本第六頌前半．","sortOrder":249},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_251","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"所緣差別體相.如雲","sortOrder":251},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_252","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]識有彼相故等。","sortOrder":252},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_253","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"明不假藉外事爲境.如情所計境相隨生.又情所計若離於識非外有故.","sortOrder":253},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_254","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"此之境相元不離識.","sortOrder":254},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_255","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由此名爲內境相也。此中內聲言不離識.本無其外.望誰爲內。","sortOrder":255},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_256","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"及從此生.","sortOrder":256},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_257","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"有此方生.或可從此.由第七五義有別故。由非離境得有其識.是故有此方乃識生.","sortOrder":257},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_258","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"不言第五。","sortOrder":258},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_259","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"二法合故.","sortOrder":259},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_260","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"明其所緣道理合故.顯能立也。此卽但以共相之境爲其能立.若差別者.其[二]仳若南","sortOrder":260},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_261","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"不緣外事.於其夢位以爲顯示。如說二種爲一能立.識有彼相復是識生.緣此二用","sortOrder":261},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_262","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"方成一量。","sortOrder":262},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_264","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]此牒論本第六頌後半．原文雲．以是識體故．又是彼因故．","sortOrder":264},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_265","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]Vijna^na卽識．","sortOrder":265},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_267","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"且復縱許有其內相.","sortOrder":267},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_268","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"但觀外境妄有相故言無[一]地相.如情計境生其領受.境之相狀列在於內將爲應理。","sortOrder":268},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_269","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如何是彼一分.得作同生之緣.","sortOrder":269},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_270","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"其所取分離識無故.斯之一分復還生識.便成自體相違之過.復還是彼一分性故.","sortOrder":270},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_271","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如能取分.斯乃便成匪能生性.但由外相染識而生。此卽相分與識同起.非二同時","sortOrder":271},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_272","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"有因果性.如牛兩角。又匪於其不異之事同在一時以同伴聲而合說之.亦非於識","sortOrder":272},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_273","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"別說有境.斯乃如何名同伴性。理實如是.然由相狀差別力故猜卜爲異而表宣之.","sortOrder":273},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_274","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"由有見分相分之殊.遂將此識而有差別。若如是者.緣性亦應但是所執.非分別事","sortOrder":274},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_275","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"有自性體.斯乃應成非真緣性。此罔相違.由其緣義於餘所執差別之境亦共許之.","sortOrder":275},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_276","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"如等無間滅.同分之識爲斷割時.此識亦以四種多緣而爲緣[二]也。","sortOrder":276},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_277","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"觀所緣論釋","sortOrder":277},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_279","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[一]疑係他字之誤．","sortOrder":279},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_326_280","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_326","text":"[二]以下文殘．缺論本第七頌釋無解．","sortOrder":280}],"overrides":{}}